Define OLEXTPShortcutBarPaintTheme for Integer
    Define OLExtpShortcutThemeResource for 3
    Define OLExtpShortcutThemeOffice2000 for 0
    Define OLExtpShortcutThemeOfficeXP for 1
    Define OLExtpShortcutThemeOffice2003 for 2
    Define OLExtpShortcutThemeOffice2007 for 3
    Define OLExtpShortcutThemeOffice2010 for 3
    Define OLExtpShortcutThemeNativeWinXP for 4
    Define OLExtpShortcutThemeOffice2013 for 5
    Define OLExtpShortcutThemeOffice2016 for 5
    Define OLExtpShortcutThemeVisualStudio2015 for 6
    Define OLExtpShortcutThemeNativeWindows10 for 7
    Define OLExtpShortcutThemeVisualStudio2017 for 8
    Define OLExtpShortcutThemeVisualStudio2019 for 9
    Define OLExtpShortcutThemeVisualStudio2022 for 10
    Define OLExtpShortcutThemeNativeWindows11 for 11

